<h2>Application Requirements</h2>

<ul>
<li>Valid Passport</li>
<li>Updated Curriculum Vitae (CV)</li>
<li>Recent Passport Photograph</li>
<li>Valid Email Address</li>
<li>Active Phone Number</li>
<li>Educational or Professional Certificates (where applicable)</li>
<li>Additional documents requested by the employer</li>
</ul>

